SunOS 4.0.3e - 4.1.4, Solaris 2.0 - 7, NetBSD (Tier II), OpenBSD (up to 5.9)\cell }\pard \intbl {\fs20 \row }\pard \sb240\sa240\intbl {\f4 sun4c\cell SunOS 4.1.2 - 4.1.4, Solaris 2.1 - 7, NetBSD (Tier II), OpenBSD (up to 5.9)\cell }\pard \intbl {\fs20 
\row }\pard \sb240\sa240\intbl {\f4 sun4d\cell Solaris 2.2 - 8, Linux (with patches)\cell }\pard \intbl {\fs20 \row }\pard \sb240\sa240\intbl {\f4 sun4m\cell 
