Solaris 2.5 - 10 (7 is first 64-bit release), NetBSD (Tier I), OpenBSD, Linux\cell }\pard \intbl {\fs20 \row }\pard \sb240\sa240\intbl {\f4 sun4v\cell Solaris 10 3/05 HW2 and newer and OpenBSD, Linux\cell }\pard \intbl {\fs20 \row }\pard 
